<title>USA: NewCare sells Spectrum unit to NCS.</title>
<headline>NewCare sells Spectrum unit to NCS.</headline>
<dateline>LARGO, Fla. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>NewCare Health Corp said it signed a definitive agreement to sell its Spectrum Health Services Inc subsidiary to NCS Healthcare Inc for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>The company was not available for further information.</p>
</text>
